@startuml
title State Diagram - Green Rides

[*] --> Login : User logs in


state "Login" as Login
Login : do / Validate user credentials
Login : exit / Successful login

state "Journey Details" as JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / Display journey details
JourneyDetails : do / Show route and estimated time of arrival
JourneyDetails : exit / User views journey details


state "Driving Mode" as DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / Activate driving mode
DrivingMode : do / Enable navigation and alerts
DrivingMode : exit / User chooses other options

state "Other Options" as OtherOptions
OtherOptions : entry / Choose other options
OtherOptions : do / Show available options (e.g., music, podcasts)
OtherOptions : exit / User activates driving mode


state "Place to Eat" as PlaceToEat
PlaceToEat : entry / Select a place to eat
PlaceToEat : do / Display menu and allow order placement
PlaceToEat : exit / User places an order or views menu

state "Menu" as Menu
Menu : entry / View menu
Menu : do / Show available dishes and prices
Menu : exit / User places an order


state "Order Placement" as OrderPlacement
OrderPlacement : entry / Place an order
OrderPlacement : do / Confirm order details
OrderPlacement : exit / Order is placed

state "Accident Notification" as AccidentNotification
AccidentNotification : entry / Inform authorities of accident
AccidentNotification : do / Send notification to relevant authorities
AccidentNotification : exit / Authorities notified


state "Notifications" as Notifications
Notifications : entry / Send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
Notifications : do / Display notifications on screen
Notifications : exit / User acknowledges notifications

state "Feedback" as Feedback
Feedback : entry / Provide feedback upon completion of journey
Feedback : do / Collect user feedback and ratings
Feedback : exit / Feedback is submitted


state "Completed Journey" as CompletedJourney
CompletedJourney : entry / Journey is completed
CompletedJourney : do / Display completion message
CompletedJourney : exit / User provides feedback

state "Final State" as FinalState <<final>>
FinalState : entry / System ends


Login --> JourneyDetails : Successful login
JourneyDetails --> DrivingMode : View journey details
DrivingMode --> OtherOptions : Activate driving mode
OtherOptions --> DrivingMode : Choose other options

PlaceToEat --> Menu : Select a place to eat
Menu --> PlaceToEat : View menu
OrderPlacement --> PlaceToEat : Place an order

AccidentNotification --> Notifications : Inform authorities of accident
Notifications --> AccidentNotification : Send notifications during driving or in case of an accident

Feedback --> CompletedJourney : Provide feedback upon completion of journey
CompletedJourney --> FinalState : Journey is completed


FinalState --> [*] : Completion Event
Login --> PlaceToEat : Select a place to eat after login
PlaceToEat --> OrderPlacement : Place an order
OrderPlacement --> Menu : View menu after placing an order
Menu --> PlaceToEat : Select another place to eat
Notifications --> AccidentNotification : Inform authorities of accident during driving or in case of an accident

Login --> Notifications : Send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
Notifications --> FinalState : User acknowledges notifications


@enduml
